;; Every feature of T6a/b is 3GPP's, in each command carrying the AVP;
;; RFC 6733's Vendor-Id, which this file does not hold, read through a path
;; into it.
; Type: Interpreted Constraints
; Id: rir-supported-features-vendor
; AVP: Supported-Features
; Command: Reporting-Information-Request
; Section: 6.1.9
; Versions: 18.0.0..19.2.0
"On the all reference points as specified in this specification, the Supported-Features AVP is used to identify features that have been defined by 3GPP and hence, for features defined in this document, the Vendor-Id AVP shall contain the vendor ID of 3GPP (10415)."
    requires Supported-Features/Vendor-Id = 10415


