;; Clause 6.3.3, in each answer, the twelve codes its clauses define, TS
;; 29.172's DIAMETER_ERROR_UNREACHABLE_USER (4221) among them.
; Type: Interpreted Constraints
; Id: ria-result-code-absent-with-experimental-result
; AVP: Result-Code
; Command: Reporting-Information-Answer
; Section: 6.3.3
; Versions: 18.0.0..19.2.0
"When one of the result codes defined here is included in a response, it shall be inside an Experimental-Result AVP and the Result-Code AVP shall be absent."
    absent-if Experimental-Result/Experimental-Result-Code = DIAMETER_ERROR_UNAUTHORIZED_REQUESTING_ENTITY or Experimental-Result/Experimental-Result-Code = DIAMETER_ERROR_UNAUTHORIZED_SERVICE or Experimental-Result/Experimental-Result-Code = DIAMETER_ERROR_CONFIGURATION_EVENT_STORAGE_NOT_SUCCESSFUL or Experimental-Result/Experimental-Result-Code = DIAMETER_ERROR_CONFIGURATION_EVENT_NON_EXISTANT or Experimental-Result/Experimental-Result-Code = DIAMETER_ERROR_REQUESTED_LOCATION_NOT_SERVED or Experimental-Result/Experimental-Result-Code = DIAMETER_ERROR_USER_UNKNOWN or Experimental-Result/Experimental-Result-Code = DIAMETER_ERROR_OPERATION_NOT_ALLOWED or Experimental-Result/Experimental-Result-Code = DIAMETER_ERROR_INVALID_EPS_BEARER or Experimental-Result/Experimental-Result-Code = DIAMETER_ERROR_NIDD_CONFIGURATION_NOT_AVAILABLE or Experimental-Result/Experimental-Result-Code = DIAMETER_ERROR_SCEF_REFERENCE_ID_UNKNOWN or Experimental-Result/Experimental-Result-Code = DIAMETER_ERROR_USER_TEMPORARILY_UNREACHABLE or Experimental-Result/Experimental-Result-Code = DIAMETER_ERROR_UNREACHABLE_USER


; Type: Interpreted Constraints
; Id: cia-result-code-absent-with-experimental-result
; AVP: Result-Code
; Command: Configuration-Information-Answer
; Section: 6.3.3
; Versions: 18.0.0..19.2.0
"When one of the result codes defined here is included in a response, it shall be inside an Experimental-Result AVP and the Result-Code AVP shall be absent."
    absent-if Experimental-Result/Experimental-Result-Code = DIAMETER_ERROR_UNAUTHORIZED_REQUESTING_ENTITY or Experimental-Result/Experimental-Result-Code = DIAMETER_ERROR_UNAUTHORIZED_SERVICE or Experimental-Result/Experimental-Result-Code = DIAMETER_ERROR_CONFIGURATION_EVENT_STORAGE_NOT_SUCCESSFUL or Experimental-Result/Experimental-Result-Code = DIAMETER_ERROR_CONFIGURATION_EVENT_NON_EXISTANT or Experimental-Result/Experimental-Result-Code = DIAMETER_ERROR_REQUESTED_LOCATION_NOT_SERVED or Experimental-Result/Experimental-Result-Code = DIAMETER_ERROR_USER_UNKNOWN or Experimental-Result/Experimental-Result-Code = DIAMETER_ERROR_OPERATION_NOT_ALLOWED or Experimental-Result/Experimental-Result-Code = DIAMETER_ERROR_INVALID_EPS_BEARER or Experimental-Result/Experimental-Result-Code = DIAMETER_ERROR_NIDD_CONFIGURATION_NOT_AVAILABLE or Experimental-Result/Experimental-Result-Code = DIAMETER_ERROR_SCEF_REFERENCE_ID_UNKNOWN or Experimental-Result/Experimental-Result-Code = DIAMETER_ERROR_USER_TEMPORARILY_UNREACHABLE or Experimental-Result/Experimental-Result-Code = DIAMETER_ERROR_UNREACHABLE_USER


