;; A feature both nodes support.
; Type: Interpreted Constraints
; Id: monitoring-event-configuration-extended-reference-ids
; AVP: SCEF-Reference-ID-Ext
; Within: Monitoring-Event-Configuration
; Section: 6.4.2
; Versions: 18.0.0..19.2.0
"When the \"Extended Reference IDs\" feature is supported by the SCEF and MME/SGSN, the SCEF-Reference-ID-Ext and SCEF-Reference-ID-for-Deletion-Ext AVPs shall be used insted of SCEF-Reference-ID and SCEF-Reference-ID-for-Deletion respectively."
    text-only


; Type: Interpreted Constraints
; Id: s1ap-cause-coding
; AVP: S1AP-Cause
; Section: 6.4.6
; Versions: 18.0.0..19.2.0
"It shall contain a non-transparent copy of the S1AP cause code as specified clause 9.2.1.3 of"
"TS 36.413 [13]."
    encoding element TS36.413 9.2.1.3 "Cause"


; Type: Interpreted Constraints
; Id: ranap-cause-coding
; AVP: RANAP-Cause
; Section: 6.4.7
; Versions: 18.0.0..19.2.0
"It shall contain the non-transparent copy of the cause value of the RANAP cause code as specified in clause 9.2.1.4 of"
"TS 25.413 [11]."
    encoding element TS25.413 9.2.1.4 "Cause"


; Type: Interpreted Constraints
; Id: bssgp-cause-coding
; AVP: BSSGP-Cause
; Section: 6.4.8
; Versions: 18.0.0..19.2.0
"It shall contain the non-transparent copy of the cause value of the BSSGP \"Cause\" as specified in clause 11.3.8 in"
"TS 48.018 [14]."
    encoding element TS48.018 11.3.8 "Cause"


; Type: Interpreted Constraints
; Id: gmm-cause-coding
; AVP: GMM-Cause
; Section: 6.4.9
; Versions: 18.0.0..19.2.0
"It shall contain the GMM cause code as specified in clause 10.5.5.14 of"
"TS 24.008 [12]."
    encoding element TS24.008 10.5.5.14 "GMM cause"


; Type: Interpreted Constraints
; Id: sm-cause-coding
; AVP: SM-Cause
; Section: 6.4.10
; Versions: 18.0.0..19.2.0
"It shall contain the SM cause code as specified in clause 10.5.6.6 and 10.5.6.6A of"
"TS 24.008 [12]."
    encoding element TS24.008 10.5.6.6 "SM cause"


; Type: Interpreted Constraints
; Id: service-selection-labels
; AVP: Service-Selection
; Section: 6.4.20
; Versions: 18.0.0..19.2.0
"The contents of the Service-Selection AVP shall be formatted as a character string composed of one or more labels separated by dots (\".\")."
    encoding labels


;; 0 deactivates the rate control; an active one is at least 10.
; Type: Interpreted Constraints
; Id: downlink-rate-limit-activated
; AVP: Downlink-Rate-Limit
; Within: Serving-PLMN-Rate-Control
; Section: 6.4.21
; Versions: 18.0.0..19.2.0
"A Downlink-Rate-Limit set to 0 shall be interpreted that the Serving PLMN Rate Control for downlink messages is deactivated in the MME."
"If the Serving PLMN Rate Control is activated, the value of Downlink-Rate-Limit shall not be less than 10"
    exclude 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8, 9


; Type: Interpreted Constraints
; Id: uplink-rate-limit-activated
; AVP: Uplink-Rate-Limit
; Within: Serving-PLMN-Rate-Control
; Section: 6.4.21
; Versions: 18.0.0..19.2.0
"An Uplink-Rate-Limit set ot 0 shall be interpreted that the Serving PLMN Rate Control for uplink messages is deactivated in the MME."
"If Serving PLMN Rate Control is activated, the value of Uplink-Rate-Limit shall not be less than 10"
    exclude 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8, 9


; Type: Interpreted Constraints
; Id: cmr-flags-undefined-bits
; AVP: CMR-Flags
; Section: 6.4.25
; Table: 6.4.25/1
; Versions: 18.0.0..19.2.0
"NOTE 1: Bits not defined in this table shall be cleared by the sending entity and discarded by the receiving entity."
    bits only 0


; Type: Interpreted Constraints
; Id: extended-pco-value
; AVP: Extended-PCO
; Section: 6.4.26
; Versions: 18.0.0..19.2.0
"The Extended-PCO AVP shall contain the value part of the ePCO IE, starting from octet 4, as specified in clause 9.9.4.26 of"
"TS 24.301[28]."
    encoding element TS24.301 9.9.4.26 "Extended protocol configuration options"


; Type: Interpreted Constraints
; Id: tda-flags-undefined-bits
; AVP: TDA-Flags
; Section: 6.4.31
; Table: 6.4.31-1
; Versions: 18.0.0..19.2.0
"NOTE Bits not defined in this table shall be cleared by the sending entity and discarded by the receiving entity."
    bits only 0


; Type: Interpreted Constraints
; Id: uplink-number-of-packets-allowed-octets
; AVP: Uplink-Number-Of-Packets-Allowed
; Section: 6.4.37
; Versions: 18.0.0..19.2.0
"It shall contain information of octets k+1 to k+4 as specified in figure 8.38-10 of"
"TS 29.274 [33]."
    encoding element TS29.274 8.38 "Uplink number of packets allowed"


; Type: Interpreted Constraints
; Id: number-of-additional-exception-reports-octets
; AVP: Number-Of-Additional-Exception-Reports
; Section: 6.4.38
; Versions: 18.0.0..19.2.0
"It shall contain information of octets k+5 to k+8 as specified in figure 8.38-10 of"
"TS 29.274 [33]."
    encoding element TS29.274 8.38 "Number of additional exception reports"


; Type: Interpreted Constraints
; Id: downlink-number-of-packets-allowed-octets
; AVP: Downlink-Number-Of-Packets-Allowed
; Section: 6.4.39
; Versions: 18.0.0..19.2.0
"It shall contain information of octets k+9 to k+12 as specified in figure 8.38-10 of"
"TS 29.274 [33]."
    encoding element TS29.274 8.38 "Downlink number of packets allowed"


; Type: Interpreted Constraints
; Id: apn-rate-control-status-validity-time-octets
; AVP: APN-Rate-Control-Status-Validity-Time
; Section: 6.4.40
; Versions: 18.0.0..19.2.0
"It shall contain information of octets k+13 to k+20 as specified in figure 8.38-10 of"
"TS 29.274 [33]."
    encoding element TS29.274 8.38 "APN Rate Control Status validity Time"
